    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for tick label formatters. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Subclasses implement <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1TickLabelFormatter_1a84fb0b326dd0923d83be291369bc05b8" kindref="member">doFormat()</ref></computeroutput> to produce a display string for each tick value. An optional <computeroutput>tickLabel</computeroutput> JavaScript callback can override the default formatting at the QML level.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1NumericTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">NumericTickLabelFormatter</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DateTimeTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">DateTimeTickLabelFormatter</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LogTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">LogTickLabelFormatter</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1TextTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">TextTickLabelFormatter</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
